サクラあっぱれーしょん
[Song: Sakura Apparation]

164
00:16:03,133 --> 00:16:06,233
Hey yo, d.e.m.p.a from Akihabara to everywhere!

165
00:16:06,233 --> 00:16:09,633
さあさあ 寄ってらっしゃい見てらっしゃい もう一切合切やっちゃいな
Come on, gather around, take a look! Just do absolutely everything!

166
00:16:09,633 --> 00:16:13,133
ありったけの可愛いと楽しい事詰め込んで
Packed with as much cuteness and fun as possible!

167
