さあ少年少女よ 船に乗っていざ出航じゃ
Now, boys and girls, get on the ship and let's set sail!

168
00:16:22,633 --> 00:16:26,133
Hey yo, d.e.m.p.a from Japanese hot area!

169
00:16:26,133 --> 00:16:28,633
みんな元気ですか？声聞かせて？
Is everyone doing well? Let me hear your voice!

170
00:16:28,633 --> 00:16:30,633
はい！でんぱー！ (でんぱー！)
Yes, Dempa! (Dempa!)

171
00:16:30,633 --> 00:16:33,633
ありがとさん もはや準備はバッチリのようね
Thank you! It seems you're already fully prepared!

172
00:16:33,633 --> 00:16:36,633
さぁ今からでっかい船にのっていざ出航じゃ
Now, get on the giant ship and let's set sail!

173
