177
00:16:50,133 --> 00:16:54,133
シェイプシェイプシェイプ 胸を張っては 汗たらり
Shape, shape, shape! Standing tall, sweat dripping down

178
00:16:54,133 --> 00:16:57,133
突っ走ってもこっちこっちこっち 逆方向
Even if we run headlong, it's this way, this way, this way—the opposite direction!

179
00:16:57,133 --> 00:17:00,133
青春はそれでいいのだ 勘違いも味方にしちゃうのだ
That's totally fine for youth! We'll even make misunderstandings our allies!

180
00:17:01,133 --> 00:17:04,633
森羅万象歌え日本踊れ日本 (あ ソレソレソレ)
All creation, sing Japan! Dance Japan! (Ah, sore, sore, sore!)

181
00:17:04,633 --> 00:17:09,633
ちんとんてんしゃんとどこまでも
Chinton tenshyan, to the ends of the earth!

182
00:17:09,633 --> 00:17:11,633
ほらパワフル全快で突き抜けろ
Look, break through with full-throttle power!

183
00:17:11,633 --> 00:17:14,633
あっちもこっちもそっちも 祭りだわっしょい
Here, there, and everywhere, it's a festival! Wasshoi!

184
00:17:14,633 --> 00:17:18,133
あっぱれあっぱれアドベンチャー
Splendid, splendid adventure!

185
00:17:18,133 --> 00:17:21,633
大和の国へ摩訶不思議な言霊
To the land of Yamato, mysterious spirits of language

186
00:17:21,633 --> 00:17:25,133
奇想天外さいつまでも
Always bizarre and unpredictable!

187
