同じ阿呆なら踊らにゃ損損損
If we're both fools, you lose out if you don't dance!

194
00:18:07,633 --> 00:18:10,633
さあみんなダンスダンスダンス さらし巻いておへそちらり
Now everyone, dance, dance, dance! Wrapping sarashi chest-binders, navels peeking out

195
