小指キュッて縛って
Tie our pinkies tight

287
00:26:16,921 --> 00:26:20,321
そうよ 一生一緒がいいもん
That's right, I want us to be together forever

288
00:26:20,321 --> 00:26:24,121
とくベチュが欲しい
I want your special kiss

289
00:26:32,121 --> 00:26:34,721
2人きり週末は
On weekends, just the two of us...

290
00:26:34,721 --> 00:26:35,621
Oh yeah

291
00:26:35,621 --> 00:26:38,421
奏でてよ ハーモニー
...let's play a harmony

292
00:26:38,421 --> 00:26:39,321
Oh yeah

293
00:26:39,321 --> 00:26:45,121
流れ星見たら 私を想ってほしい
When you see a shooting star, I want you to think of me

294
00:26:45,121 --> 00:26:47,921
あまあまな君なのに
Even though you're so sweet...

295
00:26:47,921 --> 00:26:48,721
Oh yeah

296
