誰にもあげない 私だけ独り占め！
I won't give you to anyone else, I'm keeping you all to myself!

302
00:27:11,121 --> 00:27:15,621
う～だって 今までの人と
Because, compared to anyone before...

303
00:27:15,621 --> 00:27:18,521
同じはいらないんです
...I don't want the same old thing

304
00:27:18,521 --> 00:27:25,121
ねえ もっと Give me more love 私のため 生きてほしいんです
Hey, give me more love, I want you to live just for me

305
