ショートケーキ イチゴみたいに座ってもいい？
Can I sit like a strawberry on top of a shortcake?

309
00:27:44,821 --> 00:27:48,321
赤く甘い恋だもん
Our love is sweet and red

310
00:27:48,321 --> 00:27:51,821
誰かにあげた 大好きも
Even the love you once gave to someone else...

311
00:27:51,821 --> 00:27:55,921
返してもらって全部私に
...take it all back and give it to me

312
00:27:55,921 --> 00:27:57,121
ちょーだい
Give it to me

313
00:27:57,121 --> 00:28:02,121
もっと！
More!

314
00:28:02,121 --> 00:28:09,421
君は神様が作る 奇跡のようなヒト
You are like a miracle created by God

315
00:28:09,421 --> 00:28:12,821
拗ねた顔も その寝顔も
Your sulking face, your sleeping face...

316
00:28:12,821 --> 00:28:17,621
守ってあげるね
...I will protect them all

317
00:28:17,621 --> 00:28:20,721
Oh baby 「I love you」じゃ足りない
Oh baby, "I love you" is not enough

318
00:28:20,721 --> 00:28:24,321
君の「特別」にして
Make me your "special" one

319
00:28:24,321 --> 00:28:30,821
ねえ もっと Give me a kiss もう私は 君でいっぱいよ
Hey, give me more kisses, I'm already so full of you

320
00:28:30,821 --> 00:28:34,721
ほどけない リボン結び
An unbreakable ribbon knot

321
00:28:34,721 --> 00:28:37,621
小指キュッて縛って
Tie our pinkies tight

322
00:28:37,621 --> 00:28:43,621
ねえ baby 最初で最後の 特別にしてね
Hey baby, make me your first and last special one

323
00:28:59,321 --> 00:29:04,321
ぱぴぷぺPOP!
[Title: Papipupe POP!]

324
00:29:04,321 --> 00:29:05,821
ミルクで乾杯～
Cheers with milk!

